# @HEAD reads the index, so a complete answer lists the files in scope the
# index doesn't hold.
args: search 'repo:sego-fake/hd@HEAD foo'
exit: 0
--- stdout
1 match  1 repo  0.1 s
query  repo:sego-fake/hd@HEAD foo

github.com/sego-fake/hd@0123456789ab:main.go
1:foo
--- stderr
sego: note: the contents of 1 file in scope aren't in the search index (1 over 1 MiB):
  big.sql  1.9 MiB
